	(text "Text dot TD AND TEXT-ON, graphics dot GDOT AND GFX-ON AND EIGHT; TEXT OR GRAPHICS, or with XOR set the\nexclusive OR (IC48/A,B, IC32/B); gated by DE3 (IC48/B). IC27 (7416, open collector) drives the DB9 TTL video\n(7 video, 8 HSYNC, 9 VSYNC) and the composite RCA (video into the sync node R11 / R12). DB9 pin 9: VSYNC\nbuffered by IC54/D, JP4 1-2 = +VSYNC (TV rate, CGA), 2-3 = -VSYNC through IC46/F (MDA)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "748a1423-099c-54d1-9cb8-5b93ac525d23"))
